{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Development\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Edit src/ and release.json, then run:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 python3 src/build.py\line
python3 tools/check_package.py\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Commit the generated Instruments/AB_ReaSampler.jsfx with your source changes. GitHub Actions checks the build and updates index.xml. Future plugin releases must increment the version in release.json.\par}
